  "description": "Library for adding localisation IDs to Inkle Ink files and exporting strings\n      as JSON, CSV, or PO/POT. Scans .ink files for lines of text, tags each line\n      with a unique stable ID, and exports the resulting string table for use in\n      localisation pipelines or audio triggering.\n\n      Requires ink_compiler.dll and ink-engine-runtime.dll from an inklecate\n      release (https://github.com/inkle/ink/releases) to be referenced in your\n      project separately.",
